<title>BARBADOS: CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGETOWN 1997-05-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scores on the second day of four-day Red Stripe Cup cricket matches on Saturday:</p>
<p>In Bridgetown: Barbados beat Windward Islands by an innings and 191 runs. Windward Islands 82 (P.Collins 4-36) and 161 Barbados 434-9 declared (F.Reifer 200, P.Wallace 121, R.Hoyte 50 not out).</p>
<p>In Charlestown, Nevis: Guyana 257 (R.Sarwan 77). Leewards Islands 150-4 (K.Arthurton 67 not out).</p>
<p>In Kingston: Trinidad and Tobago 160 and 119-4. Jamaica 226 (R.Dhanraj 4-65).</p>
